{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.toru.questionnaire",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她对着问卷想了很久",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.toru.questionnaire",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.toru.questionnaire",
    "idolId": "toru",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "嗯——……",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "睡很多觉……",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——原来如此。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "看电影……",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——嗯……",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……啊，想要衬衫。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯……",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……我问的，是『一生中想做的十件事』哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "虽然只是个小问卷——就没有更像样的吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——诶，不行吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不是说不行，只是……",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "那，制作人呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "『一生中想做的十件事』。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……那个……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯——……不，等一下——",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "很难吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "被这么一问，确实……平时想着的，也说不出来。",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——啊，想喝那个。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？……啊，要喝吗？冰咖啡。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——『想喝冰咖啡』。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，所以说透，是『一生中想做的事』啊？",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——可是，填不满啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那不是现在想做的事吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "现在想做的事，现在就得珍惜。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "明天说不定就有外星人打过来。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……哈哈。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "也有道理。那，我——",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "想做冰咖啡",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "『睡很多觉』",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          },
          {
            "label": "────",
            "nextNodeId": "140"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……呼。不是已经在做了吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——啊，嗯。这个你喝就好。",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不只是我的份，我是说也想做透的那份。",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "怎么说呢……想努力成为你的力量，大概就是这种。",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "105"
      },
      "105": {
        "id": "105",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "呼，那感觉有点像正确答案呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "106"
      },
      "106": {
        "id": "106",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "像『一生中想做的十件事』。",
        "nextNodeId": "107"
      },
      "107": {
        "id": "107",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "对吧？情绪上大概是『一辈子想做完的事』那种！",
        "nextNodeId": "108"
      },
      "108": {
        "id": "108",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "109"
      },
      "109": {
        "id": "109",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，抱歉。不过……我是抱着那种心情的。",
        "nextNodeId": "110"
      },
      "110": {
        "id": "110",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——问卷，要好好努力回答哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "111"
      },
      "111": {
        "id": "111",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "好——……",
        "nextNodeId": "112"
      },
      "112": {
        "id": "112",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "谢谢，冰咖啡。",
        "nextNodeId": "113"
      },
      "113": {
        "id": "113",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "我会喝的。"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……呼，学我。",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "『睡很多觉』，还挺好的愿望吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "对吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。不过要和『努力很多』配套。『努力很多，睡很多』。",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——你可以学哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "125"
      },
      "125": {
        "id": "125",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "呼，诶——……",
        "nextNodeId": "126"
      },
      "126": {
        "id": "126",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "感觉像是一个顶十个的答案呢。",
        "nextNodeId": "127"
      },
      "127": {
        "id": "127",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈，努力很多再睡很多的话，一辈子说不定转眼就过去了。",
        "nextNodeId": "128"
      },
      "128": {
        "id": "128",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "——那，嗯，我收下了。",
        "nextNodeId": "129"
      },
      "129": {
        "id": "129",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "那个答案，还有冰咖啡。"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……果然临时想不出来啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "呼，那就当作业。",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "我也可以当作业吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "143"
      },
      "143": {
        "id": "143",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？可以是可以——哈哈，一个都没填上吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "144"
      },
      "144": {
        "id": "144",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "145"
      },
      "145": {
        "id": "145",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那在带回去之前，先填上一两个，起个头吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "146"
      },
      "146": {
        "id": "146",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "诶——……",
        "nextNodeId": "147"
      },
      "147": {
        "id": "147",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "来嘛来嘛。想出一个就休息，我去做冰咖啡。",
        "nextNodeId": "148"
      },
      "148": {
        "id": "148",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "……啊，那我知道了。",
        "nextNodeId": "149"
      },
      "149": {
        "id": "149",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦？",
        "nextNodeId": "150"
      },
      "150": {
        "id": "150",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "嗯。『找到这个问题的答案』。",
        "nextNodeId": "151"
      },
      "151": {
        "id": "151",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——诶。",
        "nextNodeId": "152"
      },
      "152": {
        "id": "152",
        "speakerId": "toru",
        "text": "呼，我去做冰咖啡。"
      }
    }
  },
